The Notification Bug Fix
[cite_start]As analyzed above, the reason you aren't getting notifications is that your NotificationWriterService was using Propagation.MANDATORY. Since your upload is Async, the thread local transaction context is lost. Changing this to REQUIRES_NEW allows the notification to save in its own transaction block.
